{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"x":0.83690046106508476,"t":"Reading","w":0.083456770579020234,"c":1,"y":0.033800387529204889,"h":0.017521609967954044},{"x":0.0823045293160483,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Questions 31-34","w":0.17695472717285154,"y":0.081272084888328489,"c":1},{"h":0.018898772968701127,"c":1,"t":"Complete the summary using the list of words, A-G, below.","x":0.080246912215872518,"y":0.11773255852769016,"w":0.56378601074218748},{"c":1,"w":0.63991770426432282,"y":0.15253239093745918,"t":"Write the correct letter, A-G, in boxes 31-34 on your answer sheet.","x":0.082304522140078731,"h":0.018979236571331048},{"y":0.20347467615872561,"w":0.40534978230794277,"h":0.021816021140809605,"x":0.29629630214149488,"c":1,"t":"The 'algorithmication' of jobs"},{"w":0.73868311564127598,"y":0.2499999998540392,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Stella Pachidi of Cambridge Judge Business School has been focusing on the","x":0.080246919440678827},{"h":0.017453844611860836,"w":0.61111109415690101,"t":"'algorithmication' of jobs which rely not on production but on 31 ..","c":1,"x":0.076131695340530992,"y":0.27179034158048787},{"h":0.017496644818740581,"c":1,"w":0.71604939778645826,"y":0.31389870417229027,"t":"While monitoring a telecommunications company, Pachidi observed a growing","x":0.080246905925989917},{"x":0.078189299791845121,"t":"32 ...","w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.33716136623418058},{"y":0.3371613662683498,"t":"... on the recommendations made by Al, as workers begin to learn","x":0.26337448773043093,"w":0.59670781453450517,"h":0.017489796673310853,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020099992606047334,"t":"through the 'algorithm's eyes'. Meanwhile, staff are deterred from experimenting and using","w":0.82729283650716146,"y":0.35875849611297173,"x":0.078124739582279598},{"t":"their own 33 ..","x":0.078189298161665852,"y":0.38368669043201709,"h":0.014569123586018917,"w":0.12757202148437502,"c":1},{"h":0.01885982845921963,"w":0.52481557210286467,"c":1